krema (0.10.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release v0.10.0
  * Ships its own app icon (application launcher, task switcher, Discover,
    window title bars)
  * New "Zoom animation duration" setting for Parabolic and In place hover zoom
  * Independent left-click actions for single and grouped windows
  * "Selected monitors" setting keeps docks on chosen outputs
  * Enabled-by-default "Reserve screen space" for Always visible mode
  * Optional "Separate pinned and running apps" grouping
  * Focus Dock shortcut default moved from Meta+F5 to Meta+Alt+D
  * Fixed dock resizing on LayerShellQt older than 6.4 and a batch of window
    preview and click handling bugs

 -- Byeonghoon Yoo <bhyoo@bhyoo.com>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0900

krema (0.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release v0.9.0
  * Parabolic hover zoom: magnified icons push neighbours aside and the dock
    background grows (new "Zoom style" option; In place keeps old behaviour)
  * Fixed hover and click on left, right and top docks
  * Fixed full-surface blur at startup and 0% background opacity
  * Fixed icon scale, badge mode and other settings not persisting
  * Fixed clipped tooltips on vertical docks
  * Fixed window preview appearing with previews disabled
  * Restored Unity LauncherEntry badges and progress on Plasma 6.6+

 -- Byeonghoon Yoo <bhyoo@bhyoo.com>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0900

krema (0.8.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release v0.8.0
  * Multi-monitor support: Primary Only, All Screens and Follow Active Screen
  * Per-screen overrides for icon size, edge, visibility, background and
    pinned launchers
  * Virtual desktop filtering with dimmed icons for other desktops
  * Dock and window previews follow the Plasma primary output
  * Show Desktop (Meta+D) no longer hides the dock
  * Clicking a grouped app now cycles through its windows
  * Fixed crashes when changing monitor mode or quitting with Settings open
  * Fixed launching from the application menu (DBusActivatable removed)

 -- Byeonghoon Yoo <bhyoo@bhyoo.com>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0900

krema (0.7.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add missing runtime QML module dependencies so the Settings dialog and
    dock UI load on minimal installs:
    qml6-module-org-kde-kirigamiaddons-settings,
    qml6-module-org-kde-kirigamiaddons-formcard, qml6-module-qtquick-effects

 -- Byeonghoon Yoo <bhyoo@bhyoo.com>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0900

krema (0.7.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix runtime dependency names for openSUSE Tumbleweed/Leap 16.0 and Debian/Ubuntu
    so the package installs cleanly against current distribution repositories

 -- Byeonghoon Yoo <bhyoo@bhyoo.com>  Thu, 28 May 2026 00:00:00 +0900

krema (0.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release v0.7.0
  * Task progress bars on dock icons
  * Configurable badge display modes (Number, Dot, Off)
  * Attention animation auto-stop with adjustable duration
  * Manual notification clearing via context menu
  * Do Not Disturb integration
  * Fixed notification badge clearing on focus
  * Fixed dodge mode resumption after settings close

